title: Financial AI Systems
abstract: Quantitative finance prototypes spanning contagion monitoring, regulatory filing analysis, data
  provenance, tokenized fixed income, volatility forecasting and portfolio optimization. Projects whose
  evaluation protocol does not support a performance claim record that fact in the results file instead
  of publishing the number.
